<title>GERMANY: German Vereinsbank raises rating on Boss.</title>
<headline>German Vereinsbank raises rating on Boss.</headline>
<dateline>FRANKFURT 1997-04-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Germany's Vereinsbank said on Tuesday it had raised its rating on Boss to above average from neutral.</p>
